1. Tenable Discovered STIGS FAILURE WN10-SO-000167

Registry Hive: HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE
Registry Path: \SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Control\Lsa\

Value Name: RestrictRemoteSAM

Value Type: REG_SZ
Value: O:BAG:BAD:(A;;RC;;;BA)

2. Followed advice given from Tenanble in the Check column
3. Found that \SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Control\Lsa\RestrictRemoteSAM was not created: The below code set the value:
# Define registry path and desired value
$regPath = "HKLM:\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Control\Lsa\"

# Create the path if it doesn't exist
if (-not (Test-Path $regPath)) {
    New-Item -Path $regPath -Force | Out-Null
}

Set-ItemProperty -Path $regPath -Name "RestrictRemoteSAM" -Value 0 -Type DWord
4. Restarted the computer and check if the value was there. The value was there
5. Run Tenable and WN10-SO-000167 passed
